hpc:SlurmJobMeta a owl:Class .
hpc:SlurmJobMeta rdfs:subClassOf owl:Object .

hpc:cluster rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmJobMeta ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:release rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmJobMeta ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:version rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmJobMeta ;
    rdfs:range hpc:SlurmVersion .

hpc:SlurmVersion a owl:Class .
hpc:SlurmVersion rdfs:subClassOf owl:Object .

hpc:major rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmVersion ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:micro rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmVersion ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:minor rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmVersion ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:status rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmJobMeta ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
```

This ontology fragment describes the `SlurmJobMeta` class, which represents metadata for a SLURM job. It also defines the `SlurmVersion` class, which represents a version of SLURM, and several properties for these classes, such as `cluster`, `release`, `version`, `major`, `micro`, and `minor`. The `status` property is also defined, but it is a datatype property with a string range, which may not be accurate for representing the status of a job.
